title: "Analysis code for: Engineering signaling centers to trigger human trunk morphogenesis in vitro"
abstract: >-
  Image analysis, single-cell RNA-seq and bulk RNA-seq analysis code for the trunk morph study, with
  the SMD runner scripts and the derivative measurement tables the quantitative imaging panels are
  drawn from.
